    "body": "Simply adding `--status=$STATUS --cmd-duration=$STARSHIP_DURATION` to the call inside `zle-map-select` gets this working. But it breaks \r\n\r\n```\r\nTo fix this, we create STARSHIP_START_TIME upon preexec() firing, and destroy it\r\nafter drawing the prompt. This ensures that the timing for one command is only\r\never drawn once (for the prompt immediately after it is run).\r\n```\r\n\r\nsince pressing enter then changing keymap will suddenly include the duration again.\r\n",
